# NK conformance drivers nkc-cross and nkc-cross-b (exceptions that
# cross the kernel).
#
# nkc-cross sends requests of its own making to nkc-cross-b with a __try
# around IoCallDriver; the far side raises in its dispatch routine, or
# completes the request so that the sender's completion routine raises
# inside IoCompleteRequest. One request returns what the sender's
# filters, __finally blocks and handlers saw, 32 bits each, ending with
# 0x4E4B4321. What each value means is written beside it in nk-fixtures
# nkc/nkc-cross.c. The second request gets the same list.

load nkc-cross-b nkc-cross-b.sys
load nkc-cross nkc-cross.sys
open d \Device\NkcCross
ioctl d 00222000 - 256
ioctl d 00222000 - 256
close d
unload nkc-cross
unload nkc-cross-b
